{
 "cells": [
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "# Prediksi Ketinggian Muka Air (Tinggi Muka Air - TMA) Menggunakan Gradient Boosting\n",
    "## Water Level Prediction (Tinggi Muka Air - TMA) using Gradient Boosting\n",
    "\n",
    "Notebook ini mengimplementasikan pipeline pembelajaran mesin (machine learning) untuk memprediksi Tinggi Muka Air (TMA) di berbagai pos pemantauan. Model yang digunakan adalah algoritma gradient boosting berbasis tabel (LightGBM, XGBoost, CatBoost). \n",
    "\n",
    "### Komponen Utama (Key Components):\n",
    "1. **Analisis Eksplorasi Data (EDA)**: Memahami karakteristik pencilan (outliers), data hilang, pola musiman, dan lag autokorelasi.\n",
    "2. **Pembersihan & Imputasi Data**: Membersihkan data tanpa menimbulkan kebocoran data (data leakage).\n",
    "3. **Rekayasa Fitur (Feature Engineering)**: Membuat fitur lag, statistik bergulir, indeks hidrologi fisik (Antecedent Precipitation Index), interaksi wilayah spasial, dan penelusuran aliran sungai menggunakan Geopandas/HydroRIVERS.\n",
    "4. **Validasi & Evaluasi Rekursif**: Menerapkan simulasi walk-forward untuk mengukur akumulasi kesalahan prediksi deret waktu.\n",
    "5. **Prediksi Akhir (Inference)**: Melatih kembali model pada seluruh data dan menerapkan pembatasan nilai (*boundary clipping*) untuk stabilitas hasil."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 1. Impor Pustaka & Data (Import Libraries & Data)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.1 Impor Pustaka (Import Libraries)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Setup Selesai. Pustaka berhasil dimuat.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "import os\n",
    "import math\n",
    "import warnings\n",
    "import numpy as np\n",
    "import pandas as pd\n",
    "import matplotlib.pyplot as plt\n",
    "import seaborn as sns\n",
    "\n",
    "import lightgbm as lgb\n",
    "from lightgbm import LGBMRegressor\n",
    "from xgboost import XGBRegressor\n",
    "from catboost import CatBoostRegressor\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import mean_squared_error, mean_absolute_error\n",
    "from statsmodels.graphics.tsaplots import plot_acf, plot_pacf\n",
    "\n",
    "# Abaikan pesan peringatan untuk output yang lebih bersih\n",
    "warnings.filterwarnings('ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Konfigurasi estetika plot\n",
    "plt.style.use('seaborn-v0_8-whitegrid')\n",
    "sns.set_palette('muted')\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Setup Selesai. Pustaka berhasil dimuat.\")"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 1.2 Impor Dataset (Import Dataset)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 2,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "BASE = 'sebelas-maret-statistics-data-science-2026'\n",
    "\n",
    "train_df = pd.read_csv(f'{BASE}/train.csv')\n",
    "test_df = pd.read_csv(f'{BASE}/test.csv')\n",
    "env_df = pd.read_csv(f'{BASE}/data_pendukung/data_lingkungan.csv')\n",
    "koordinat_df = pd.read_csv(f'{BASE}/data_pendukung/koordinat_pos.csv')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Gabungkan koordinat stasiun dengan data lingkungan\n",
    "env_df = pd.merge(env_df, koordinat_df, on='nama_pos', how='left')\n",
    "\n",
    "# Ubah kolom datetime menjadi objek pandas datetime\n",
    "train_df['datetime'] = pd.to_datetime(train_df['datetime'])\n",
    "env_df['datetime'] = pd.to_datetime(env_df['datetime'])\n",
    "\n",
    "# Pisahkan ID pengujian untuk mendapatkan datetime dan ID stasiun\n",
    "id_split = test_df['id'].str.split(' - ', n=1, expand=True)\n",
    "test_df['datetime'] = pd.to_datetime(id_split[0])\n",
    "test_df['nama_pos'] = id_split[1]\n",
    "\n",
    "# Ambil daftar stasiun unik yang terurut secara alfabetis\n",
    "daftar_pos = sorted(train_df['nama_pos'].unique())"
   ]
  },
