   "source": [
    "## 3. Pembersihan & Pra-pemrosesan Data (Data Cleaning & Preprocessing)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.1 Capping Pencilan dengan Metode IQR (Outlier Handling via IQR Capping)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Nilai TMA ekstrim bawah di bawah `Q1 - 3.0 * IQR` dibatasi (clipped) per pos pemantauan untuk menghilangkan pembacaan sensor yang salah (eror) tanpa mempengaruhi nilai tinggi (banjir) yang penting bagi model."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 14,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      ">>> Before Capping Outlier (nilai TERTINGGI per pos, TIDAK disentuh)\n",
      "nama_pos\n",
      "Napel                        325.830000\n",
      "Kali Anyar - Kreteg Abang    323.207409\n",
      "Jarum                        250.140000\n",
      "Bojonegoro - Kali Kethek     225.130000\n",
      "Kedungupit                   207.736480\n",
      "Name: tma_mdpl, dtype: float64\n",
      "\n",
      "After Capping Outlier (nilai TERENDAH per pos)\n",
      "nama_pos\n",
      "Bojonegoro - Kali Kethek    0.000000\n",
      "Karanggeneng                0.000000\n",
      "Arjowinangun - Pacitan      0.347639\n",
      "Floodway Bridge C           2.039797\n",
      "Boboh Kali Lamong           2.100000\n",
      "Name: tma_mdpl, dtype: float64\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def cap_lower_iqr(series, multiplier=3.0):\n",
    "    Q1 = series.quantile(0.25)\n",
    "    Q3 = series.quantile(0.75)\n",
    "    IQR = Q3 - Q1\n",
    "    lower_bound = Q1 - (multiplier * IQR)\n",
    "    return series.clip(lower=lower_bound)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\">>> Before Capping Outlier (nilai TERTINGGI per pos, TIDAK disentuh)\")\n",
    "print(train_df.groupby(\"nama_pos\")[\"tma_mdpl\"].max().sort_values(ascending=False).head(5))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Batasi pencilan bawah target TMA per stasiun\n",
    "train_df[\"tma_mdpl\"] = (\n",
    "    train_df.groupby(\"nama_pos\")[\"tma_mdpl\"]\n",
    "    .transform(cap_lower_iqr)\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nAfter Capping Outlier (nilai TERENDAH per pos)\")\n",
    "print(train_df.groupby(\"nama_pos\")[\"tma_mdpl\"].min().sort_values().head(5))"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.2 Penghapusan Duplikat & Imputasi Data Hilang (Duplicate Removal & Missing Value Imputation)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "1. **Penghapusan Duplikat**: Baris dengan stasiun dan waktu yang sama dihapus untuk mencegah kebocoran data.\n",
    "2. **Interpolasi Linier (Limit=6)**: Mengisi kekosongan fitur kontinu. Pembatasan rentang hingga 6 jam dilakukan agar tidak membuat garis lurus pada kekosongan sensor yang lama (outage).\n",
    "3. **ffill/bfill**: Mengisi variabel diskrit berdasarkan data terakhir yang diketahui."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 15,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Jumlah baris kosong sebelum imputasi:\n",
      "soil_moisture_0_7cm          720\n",
      "soil_moisture_7_28cm         720\n",
      "soil_moisture_28_100cm       720\n",
      "soil_moisture_100_255cm      720\n",
      "surface_pressure_hpa         720\n",
      "pressure_msl_hpa             720\n",
      "rmm1                         720\n",
      "rmm2                         720\n",
      "mjo_phase                    720\n",
      "mjo_amplitude                720\n",
      "mjo_active                   720\n",
      "nino_34                    12960\n",
      "dtype: int64\n",
      "\n",
      "Jumlah baris kosong setelah imputasi: 0\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def drop_pos_datetime_duplicates(df):\n",
    "    return df.drop_duplicates(subset=['nama_pos', 'datetime']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 1. Hapus duplikat\n",
    "train_df = drop_pos_datetime_duplicates(train_df)\n",
    "env_df = drop_pos_datetime_duplicates(env_df)\n",
    "test_df = drop_pos_datetime_duplicates(test_df)\n",
    "\n",
    "# 2. Urutkan secara kronologis per stasiun\n",
    "train_df = train_df.sort_values(['nama_pos', 'datetime']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "env_df = env_df.sort_values(['nama_pos', 'datetime']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "test_df = test_df.sort_values(['nama_pos', 'datetime']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Jumlah baris kosong sebelum imputasi:')\n",
    "print(env_df.isnull().sum()[env_df.isnull().sum() > 0])\n",
    "\n",
    "# 3. Imputasi fitur lingkungan diskrit menggunakan forward fill & backward fill\n",
    "kolom_diskrit = ['mjo_phase', 'mjo_active', 'landcover_class', 'nino_34']\n",
    "for col in kolom_diskrit:\n",
    "    if col in env_df.columns:\n",
    "        env_df[col] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')[col].transform(lambda x: x.ffill().bfill())\n",
    "\n",
    "# 4. Imputasi fitur kontinu dengan interpolasi linier (maksimal rentang 6 jam)\n",
    "kolom_kontinu = [\n",
    "    c for c in env_df.columns \n",
    "    if c not in kolom_diskrit and c not in ['datetime', 'nama_pos', 'landcover_name', 'latitude', 'longitude']\n",
    "]\n",
    "for col in kolom_kontinu:\n",
    "    env_df[col] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')[col].transform(\n",
    "        lambda x: x.interpolate(method='linear', limit=6, limit_direction='both')\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "# 5. Isi sisa nilai kosong di tepi dengan ffill lalu bfill\n",
    "for col in kolom_kontinu:\n",
    "    env_df[col] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')[col].transform(lambda x: x.ffill().bfill())\n",
    "\n",
    "print('\\nJumlah baris kosong setelah imputasi:', env_df.isnull().sum().sum())"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 3.3 Fitur Spasial: Koordinat & Metrik Jarak (Spatial Coordinate Features)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Jarak ke stasiun terdekat (Nearest Neighbor) dan ke pusat stasiun (Centroid) dihitung dengan rumus Haversine untuk membantu model mempelajari pola spasial dan kerapatan geografis stasiun."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 16,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur spasial stasiun ditambahkan: latitude, longitude, nearest_station_dist_km, station_centroid_dist_km\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "coords = koordinat_df[['nama_pos', 'latitude', 'longitude']].drop_duplicates().copy()\n",
    "coords = coords.dropna(subset=['latitude', 'longitude']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "coords_xy = coords.set_index('nama_pos')[['latitude', 'longitude']]\n",
    "station_centroid_lat = coords_xy['latitude'].mean()\n",
    "station_centroid_lon = coords_xy['longitude'].mean()\n",
    "\n",
    "nearest_station_dist_km = {}\n",
    "station_centroid_dist_km = {}\n",
    "\n",
    "# Perhitungan jarak menggunakan formula Haversine\n",
    "for pos in coords_xy.index:\n",
    "    lat1 = coords_xy.loc[pos, 'latitude']\n",
    "    lon1 = coords_xy.loc[pos, 'longitude']\n",
    "    other = coords_xy.drop(index=pos, errors='ignore')\n",
    "\n",
    "    if other.empty:\n",
    "        nearest_station_dist_km[pos] = np.nan\n",
    "    else:\n",
    "        dlat = np.radians(other['latitude'].values - lat1)\n",
    "        dlon = np.radians(other['longitude'].values - lon1)\n",
    "        a = (\n",
    "            np.sin(dlat / 2) ** 2 \n",
    "            + np.cos(np.radians(lat1)) * np.cos(np.radians(other['latitude'].values)) * np.sin(dlon / 2) ** 2\n",
    "        )\n",
    "        dist = 2 * 6371 * np.arctan2(np.sqrt(a), np.sqrt(1 - a))\n",
    "        nearest_station_dist_km[pos] = float(np.min(dist))\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Jarak ke centroid\n",
    "    dlat_c = np.radians(station_centroid_lat - lat1)\n",
    "    dlon_c = np.radians(station_centroid_lon - lon1)\n",
    "    a_c = (\n",
    "        np.sin(dlat_c / 2) ** 2 \n",
    "        + np.cos(np.radians(lat1)) * np.cos(np.radians(station_centroid_lat)) * np.sin(dlon_c / 2) ** 2\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    station_centroid_dist_km[pos] = float(2 * 6371 * np.arctan2(np.sqrt(a_c), np.sqrt(1 - a_c)))\n",
    "\n",
    "# Gabungkan fitur koordinat dan jarak ke dalam dataset\n",
    "train_df = train_df.merge(coords, on='nama_pos', how='left')\n",
    "test_df = test_df.merge(coords, on='nama_pos', how='left')\n",
    "train_df['nearest_station_dist_km'] = train_df['nama_pos'].map(nearest_station_dist_km)\n",
    "test_df['nearest_station_dist_km'] = test_df['nama_pos'].map(nearest_station_dist_km)\n",
    "train_df['station_centroid_dist_km'] = train_df['nama_pos'].map(station_centroid_dist_km)\n",
    "test_df['station_centroid_dist_km'] = test_df['nama_pos'].map(station_centroid_dist_km)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Fitur spasial stasiun ditambahkan: latitude, longitude, nearest_station_dist_km, station_centroid_dist_km')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "## 4. Rekayasa Fitur (Feature Engineering)\n",
    "\n",
    "Rekayasa fitur bertujuan untuk mengekstrak fitur temporal, meteorologis, dan hidrologis untuk pemodelan regresi tabular. Kita membuat lag, statistik bergulir, indeks fisik hidrologi, dan hubungan sungai (HydroRIVERS)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 17,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Memulai Feature Engineering...\n",
      "Data telah diurutkan dengan benar.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "print('Memulai Feature Engineering...')\n",
    "\n",
    "train_df = train_df.sort_values(['nama_pos', 'datetime']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "env_df = env_df.sort_values(['nama_pos', 'datetime']).reset_index(drop=True)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Data telah diurutkan dengan benar.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.1 Fitur Lag TMA (TMA Lag Features)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "TMA memiliki ketergantungan diri yang sangat kuat. Kita membuat lag `[3, 6, 9, 12, 21]` (dalam langkah observasi). Lag 1 dan 2 dilewati karena pada set pengujian terdapat celah waktu (gap) sehingga kita harus memprediksi langkah ke depan tanpa bergantung pada lag terdekat."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 18,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur Lag TMA selesai. Total kolom train_df saat ini: 12\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "LAG_STEPS = [3, 6, 9, 12, 21]\n",
    "g_tma = train_df.groupby('nama_pos')['tma_mdpl']\n",
    "for step in LAG_STEPS:\n",
    "    train_df[f'tma_lag_step{step}'] = g_tma.shift(step)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Fitur Lag TMA selesai. Total kolom train_df saat ini: {train_df.shape[1]}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.2 Fitur Lag Curah Hujan (Rainfall Lag Features)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Air hujan membutuhkan waktu untuk mengalir di atas tanah hingga masuk ke saluran sungai (runoff delay). Lag curah hujan `[1, 3, 6, 12, 24]` jam merepresentasikan penundaan waktu respons daerah aliran sungai (DAS)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 19,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur Lag Rainfall selesai. Total kolom env_df saat ini: 34\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "lag_hours_env = [1, 3, 6, 12, 24]\n",
    "\n",
    "for lag in lag_hours_env:\n",
    "    env_df[f'rainfall_lag_{lag}h'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['rainfall_mm'].shift(lag)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Fitur Lag Rainfall selesai. Total kolom env_df saat ini: {env_df.shape[1]}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.3 Fitur Statistik Bergulir TMA (TMA Rolling Features)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Nilai rata-rata, maksimum, dan minimum bergulir dari TMA sebelumnya (menggunakan shift 1 untuk mencegah kebocoran data) menangkap tren jangka pendek hingga menengah."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 20,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur Rolling TMA selesai. Total kolom train_df saat ini: 21\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "ROLL_WINDOWS = [3, 9, 21] \n",
    "\n",
    "# Perhitungan rolling pada TMA yang di-shift untuk mencegah kebocoran data target\n",
    "shifted_tma = train_df.groupby('nama_pos')['tma_mdpl'].shift(1)\n",
    "for w in ROLL_WINDOWS:\n",
    "    train_df[f'tma_rollmean_{w}'] = shifted_tma.groupby(train_df['nama_pos']).transform(lambda x: x.rolling(w, min_periods=1).mean())\n",
    "    train_df[f'tma_rollmax_{w}'] = shifted_tma.groupby(train_df['nama_pos']).transform(lambda x: x.rolling(w, min_periods=1).max())\n",
    "    train_df[f'tma_rollmin_{w}'] = shifted_tma.groupby(train_df['nama_pos']).transform(lambda x: x.rolling(w, min_periods=1).min())\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Fitur Rolling TMA selesai. Total kolom train_df saat ini: {train_df.shape[1]}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.4 Statistik Bergulir Curah Hujan & Kelembapan Tanah (Rainfall & Soil Moisture Rolling)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Akumulasi hujan (3 jam hingga 7 hari) mewakili volume air yang masuk ke DAS, sedangkan nilai maksimum bergulir menangkap intensitas hujan. Rata-rata kelembapan tanah menangkap tingkat kejenuhan tanah."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 21,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur Rolling env selesai. Total kolom env_df saat ini: 55\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "rolling_windows = [3, 6, 12, 24, 48, 72, 168]\n",
    "\n",
    "for w in rolling_windows:\n",
    "    env_df[f'rainfall_sum_{w}h'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['rainfall_mm'].transform(\n",
    "        lambda x: x.rolling(window=w, min_periods=1).sum()\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    env_df[f'rainfall_max_{w}h'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['rainfall_mm'].transform(\n",
    "        lambda x: x.rolling(window=w, min_periods=1).max()\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    if 'soil_moisture_0_7cm' in env_df.columns:\n",
    "        env_df[f'soil_moisture_0_7_mean_{w}h'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['soil_moisture_0_7cm'].transform(\n",
    "            lambda x: x.rolling(window=w, min_periods=1).mean()\n",
    "        )\n",
    "\n",
    "print(f'Fitur Rolling env selesai. Total kolom env_df saat ini: {env_df.shape[1]}')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.5 Deviasi Standar Bergulir Curah Hujan (Rainfall Rolling Std)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Mengukur volatilitas dan perubahan intensitas curah hujan bergulir yang sering memicu perubahan debit air secara mendadak."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 22,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Selesai.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "for w in [6, 24]:\n",
    "    env_df[f'rainfall_std_{w}h'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['rainfall_mm'].transform(\n",
    "        lambda x: x.rolling(window=w, min_periods=1).std()\n",
    "    )\n",
    "\n",
    "env_df[[f'rainfall_std_{w}h' for w in [6, 24]]] = env_df[[f'rainfall_std_{w}h' for w in [6, 24]]].fillna(0)\n",
    "\n",
    "print('Selesai.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.6 Indeks Akumulasi Hujan (Antecedent Precipitation Index - API)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "API memperkirakan kejenuhan tanah berdasarkan asumsi bahwa kelembapan tanah bertambah karena hujan namun menyusut secara eksponensial seiring waktu berjalan:\n",
    "$$API_t = P_t + k \\times API_{t-1}$$\n",
    "Konstanta peluruhan ($k$) diatur 0.9 per hari, lalu diskalakan secara hourly ($0.9^{1/24}$)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 23,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur API selesai ditambahkan.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def compute_api(rain_values, k):\n",
    "    api = np.zeros(len(rain_values))\n",
    "    for i in range(len(rain_values)):\n",
    "        prev = api[i - 1] if i > 0 else 0.0\n",
    "        api[i] = rain_values[i] + k * prev\n",
    "    return api\n",
    "\n",
    "k_per_hari = 0.9\n",
    "k_per_jam = k_per_hari ** (1 / 24)\n",
    "\n",
    "env_df = env_df.sort_values(['nama_pos', 'datetime'])\n",
    "env_df['api'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['rainfall_mm'].transform(\n",
    "    lambda s: compute_api(s.values, k_per_jam)\n",
    ")\n",
    "print('Fitur API selesai ditambahkan.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.7 Fitur Interaksi: Indeks Kejenuhan (Saturation Index)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Efek hujan terhadap kenaikan TMA bersifat non-linier. Hujan lebat pada tanah kering menghasilkan limpasan kecil, sedangkan hujan kecil pada tanah yang sudah jenuh air dapat memicu kenaikan TMA yang drastis. Indeks ini dibuat dari perkalian akumulasi hujan 24 jam dengan rata-rata kelembapan tanah."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 24,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur 'saturation_index' berhasil dibuat.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "if 'soil_moisture_0_7_mean_24h' in env_df.columns:\n",
    "    env_df['saturation_index'] = env_df['rainfall_sum_24h'] * env_df['soil_moisture_0_7_mean_24h']\n",
    "    print(\"Fitur 'saturation_index' berhasil dibuat.\")\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('Kolom soil_moisture_0_7_mean_24h tidak ditemukan, fitur ini dilewati.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.8 Waktu Sejak Hujan Terakhir (Hours Since Last Rain)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Menunjukkan durasi keringnya wilayah tangkapan air. Nilai yang kecil menunjukkan tanah masih basah dan peka terhadap curah hujan baru."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 25,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Selesai.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "def hitung_jam_sejak_hujan(rainfall_series, threshold=1.0):\n",
    "    is_rain = (rainfall_series > threshold)\n",
    "    reset_groups = is_rain.cumsum()\n",
    "    jam_sejak = is_rain.groupby(reset_groups).cumcount()\n",
    "    jam_sejak = jam_sejak.where(reset_groups > 0, np.nan)\n",
    "    return jam_sejak\n",
    "\n",
    "env_df['hours_since_rain'] = env_df.groupby('nama_pos')['rainfall_mm'].transform(hitung_jam_sejak_hujan)\n",
    "print('Selesai.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.9 Rata-rata Curah Hujan Wilayah Tetangga (Spatial Neighbor Mean Rainfall)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Menggunakan rata-rata curah hujan dari K stasiun terdekat untuk menghasilkan fitur hujan regional guna mengatasi keterbatasan pencatatan lokal."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 26,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "name": "stdout",
     "output_type": "stream",
     "text": [
      "Fitur rainfall_neighbor_mean ditambahkan.\n"
     ]
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "K_NEIGHBORS = 2\n",
    "coords = koordinat_df.set_index('nama_pos')[['latitude', 'longitude']] if 'latitude' in koordinat_df.columns else None\n",
    "\n",
    "if coords is not None:\n",
    "    neighbor_map = {}\n",
    "    for pos in daftar_pos:\n",
    "        if pos not in coords.index:\n",
    "            neighbor_map[pos] = []\n",
    "            continue\n",
    "        # Jarak kuadrat koordinat\n",
    "        dists = ((coords['latitude'] - coords.loc[pos, 'latitude'])**2 + (coords['longitude'] - coords.loc[pos, 'longitude'])**2)\n",
    "        dists = dists.drop(index=pos, errors='ignore').sort_values()\n",
    "        neighbor_map[pos] = dists.index[:K_NEIGHBORS].tolist()\n",
    "\n",
    "    # Ekstraksi rata-rata curah hujan stasiun terdekat\n",
    "    rainfall_wide = env_df.pivot(index='datetime', columns='nama_pos', values='rainfall_mm')\n",
    "    neighbor_rain = {}\n",
    "    for pos in daftar_pos:\n",
    "        neigh = neighbor_map.get(pos, [])\n",
    "        neighbor_rain[pos] = rainfall_wide[neigh].mean(axis=1) if neigh else pd.Series(np.nan, index=rainfall_wide.index)\n",
    "    neighbor_rain_df = (\n",
    "        pd.DataFrame(neighbor_rain).reset_index()\n",
    "        .melt(id_vars='datetime', var_name='nama_pos', value_name='rainfall_neighbor_mean')\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    env_df = env_df.merge(neighbor_rain_df, on=['nama_pos', 'datetime'], how='left')\n",
    "    print('Fitur rainfall_neighbor_mean ditambahkan.')\n",
    "else:\n",
    "    print('Kolom lat/lon tidak ditemukan — cek nama kolom di koordinat_pos.csv. Fitur dilewati.')"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "### 4.10 Penyelarasan Jaringan Sungai & Fitur Hulu (Snap to River & Upstream Features)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Air mengalir dari hulu ke hilir. Kenaikan TMA di pos hilir sangat dipengaruhi oleh TMA dan curah hujan di pos hulu. \n",
    "1. **Penyelarasan Sungai (River Snapping)**: Menggunakan Geopandas, koordinat pos diselaraskan ke ruas sungai terdekat pada database HydroRIVERS.\n",
    "2. **Identifikasi Hulu (Upstream Identification)**: Memetakan stasiun hulu yang berada pada sungai yang sama (`MAIN_RIV`) dengan jarak hilir (`DIST_DN_KM`) lebih jauh.\n",
    "3. **Fitur Hulu (Upstream Features)**: Menghitung rata-rata curah hujan dan TMA dari stasiun hulu tersebut sebagai proksi debit air kiriman hulu."
   ]
  },
