   "source": [
    "### 7.1 Analisis Kepentingan Fitur (Feature Importance Analysis)\n",
    "\n",
    "**Justifikasi (Justification):**\n",
    "Menampilkan pentingnya fitur bagi model (LightGBM, XGBoost, CatBoost) untuk memastikan keputusan pemodelan didasarkan pada fitur hidrologi yang logis secara fisik."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 7.1.1 Kepentingan Fitur LightGBM (LightGBM Feature Importance)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 46,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
      "image/png": "",
      "text/plain": [
       "<Figure size 1000x800 with 1 Axes>"
      ]
     },
     "metadata": {},
     "output_type": "display_data"
    }
   ],
   "source": [
    "importance_df = pd.DataFrame({\n",
    "    'feature': X_train.columns,\n",
    "    'importance': model_lgbm.feature_importances_\n",
    "}).sort_values('importance', ascending=False).head(20)\n",
    "\n",
    "plt.figure(figsize=(10, 8))\n",
    "sns.barplot(data=importance_df, x='importance', y='feature')\n",
    "plt.title('20 Fitur Terpenting (LightGBM)')\n",
    "plt.tight_layout()\n",
    "plt.show()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "#### 7.1.2 Kepentingan Fitur XGBoost (XGBoost Feature Importance)"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 47,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [
    {
     "data": {
